{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["預言審判巴比倫"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是亞摩斯的兒子以賽亞有關巴比倫的預言："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"你們要在光禿的山上豎立旗幟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向戰士高呼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"揮手示意他們進入貴族的城門。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已向我揀選的士兵發出命令，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已號召我的勇士去傾倒我的烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們因我的勝利而歡喜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"聽啊，山上人聲鼎沸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像是大軍的聲音。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那是列邦列國聚集吶喊的聲音。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華正在召集軍隊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"準備作戰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們從遠方，從天邊而來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那是耶和華及傾倒祂烈怒的兵器，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要來毀滅大地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"你們哀號吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華的日子近了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全能者施行毀滅的時候到了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人們都必雙手發軟，人人膽戰心驚，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"驚恐萬狀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"痛苦不堪，如同劇痛中分娩的婦人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必嚇得面面相覷，臉如火燒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"看啊，耶和華的日子來臨了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是充滿憤恨和烈怒的殘酷之日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使大地荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅地上的罪人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天上的星辰不再發光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"太陽剛出來就變黑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"月亮也暗淡無光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必懲罰這邪惡的世界，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"懲治罪惡的世人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"終結驕橫之人的狂妄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"貶抑殘暴之徒的驕傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使人比精煉的金子還稀少，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"比俄斐的純金更罕見。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我萬軍之耶和華發烈怒和義憤的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必使諸天震動，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使大地搖撼，脫離原位。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人們都投奔親族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逃回故鄉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像被追趕的羚羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如沒有牧人的羊群。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被捉的人都會被刺死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被逮的人都會喪身刀下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的嬰孩必被摔死在他們眼前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"家園遭劫掠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"妻子被蹂躪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"看啊，我要驅使瑪代人來攻擊他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瑪代人不在乎金子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不看重銀子，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必用弓箭射死青年，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們不憐憫嬰兒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不顧惜孩童。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫在列國中輝煌無比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是迦勒底人的驕傲和榮耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但上帝必毀滅它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像毀滅所多瑪和蛾摩拉一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那裡必人煙絕跡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世世代代無人居住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有阿拉伯人在那裡支搭帳篷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也無人在那裡牧放羊群。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"曠野的走獸在那裡躺臥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"咆哮的猛獸佔滿房屋；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鴕鳥住在那裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"野山羊在那裡跳躍嬉戲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豺狼在城樓上嚎叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"野狗在華美的宮殿裡狂吠。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫的結局近了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它的時候不多了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}